  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 6th level, whenever a necros uses their fleshcrafter class feature on an undead, it gains temporary hit points equal to the necros’s class level + their casting ability modifier. These temporary hit points last until the fleshcrafting ends, and can be restored by the necros by expending 1 use of channel energy while within 60 feet of the undead.</p>\n<p>At 13th level, the amount of temporary hit points gained is doubled.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/necros#toc15\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
